{"id":"n37217-1-3","stage":3,"title":"급히 · 紧急地","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37217-1-3-1","ko":"나 돈이 급히 필요한데, 빌려줄 수 있어?","zh":"我急需用钱，能借给我一点吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"돈이","meaning":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","explanation":"돈：钱，钱款，价钱，费用；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"2","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈이","audio":"/audio/6fc43b50168ec9dd1ba6.mp3"}},{"text":"급히","meaning":"紧急地","explanation":"급히：紧急地","readings":[{"term":"급히","audio":"/audio/63da876fcdd39cb64834.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37217","senseId":"1","lemma":"급히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"급히","audio":"/audio/63da876fcdd39cb64834.mp3"}},{"text":"필요한데,","meaning":"必需，必要","explanation":"필요하다：必需，必要；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"필요하다","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46945","senseId":"1","lemma":"필요하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"필요한데","audio":"/audio/8e3de23253de919dbff6.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려줄","meaning":"借；表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"빌리다：借；주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌려줄","audio":"/audio/5bf65f7c41a62cc65eb3.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"购物或做某事时所需的钱财。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"63da876fcdd39cb6","term":"급히","zh":"紧急地","audio":"/audio/63da876fcdd39cb64834.mp3","entryId":"37217","definition":"情况或境况处于必须马上处理的状态。","pronunciation":["그피"]},{"id":"b98947c9698402e3","term":"필요하다","zh":"必需，必要","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3","entryId":"46945","definition":"一定要有的。","pronunciation":["피료하다"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronu